,0:00:44.45,0:00:45.96,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:49.67,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:54.17,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:59.47,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:00.22,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Oh!Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:04.56,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.60,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,will we have the last laugh, be the winners!Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:10.12,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:12.72,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Fight, shake it off, act strong!Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:15.72,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,These are our hard knock days.Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:20.73,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as a safe choice.Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.73,0:01:23.06,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:27.32,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:29.90,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Let's put our wishes all together,Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.98,0:00:02.68,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,fDialogue: 1,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.68,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:00:02.03,0:00:02.68,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:00:02.05,0:00:02.68,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 1,0:00:02.08,0:00:02.68,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:00:02.10,0:00:02.68,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.68,0:00:03.35,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,fightDialogue: 1,0:00:02.13,0:00:03.05,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 1,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.05,Rom