 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.74,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.81,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:31.97,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.89,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:47.60,Title,,0,0,250,,Trump CardDialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:53.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Mansherry, please be safe.Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:56.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Awesome!Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:58.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You can see inside of the Palace from here?Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.27,0:02:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, with my Clairvoyance. I can send my sight wherever I want.Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:04.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji would kill for your ability.Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:08.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of person Princess Mansherry is.Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly, Leo said she's capricious, selfish, and short-tempered.Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:16.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.77,0:02:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:21.55,Main,,0,0,0,,K-Kin'emon!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, Usopp-dono! --You know him?Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can let go of him...Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:29.55,Main,,0,0,0,,There's some kind of weirdo!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,He's Kanjuro, who I've been looking for.Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:37.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that pathetic creature...?Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we surfaced earlier and were surprised.Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:50.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Tons of people are heading towards this plateau so I wondered what's going on.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:52.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:56.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think they can climb this high, but...Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:03:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, long-nosed goblin man! They were having trouble so...Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I made a net for them!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:04.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:08.40,Main,,0,0,0,,They will be here any minute now.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you do such a thing, you fool?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch God Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,This rope sucks!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,--They're coming to get me! --Was it unnecessary?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,How foolish I've been...Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:27.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I made a blunder! I failed my savior!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The only amends at this point is ritual suicide.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't, Kanjuro!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:32.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I won't.Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Do it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:36.31,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do about those climbers?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.47,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Maybe...Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:42.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I haven't looked in that room!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:53.66,Captions,,700,0,560,,Ascending Above the  Second StepDialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:53.66,Captions,,0,900,630,,Team Rebecca & RobinDialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:04:00.47,Main,,0,0,0,,--Leo! Can you hear me? --Yes, Viola-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I found Princess Mansherry!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:06.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The Palace! Princess Mansherry's in the Palace!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:09.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Great! Where in the Palace?Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.13,0:04:12.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The small room at the back of the chapel...Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:13.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember?Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.61,Main,,0,0,0,,A small...Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:17.59,Main,,0,0,0,,...room?Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The naughty room!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:20.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:24.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I just remembered Scarlet-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:25.51,Main,,0,0,0,,My mother?Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:26.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,When we used to go to the Palace,Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:33.86,Main,,0,0,0,,we were mischievous with Viola-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:36.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And we'd get scolded by King Riku-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,--Big Sis! --Scarlet-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:46.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you get scolded again? You never learn.Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault! Leo and those two broke a plate!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:52.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You told us we could "break" it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I said you could "touch" it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll come and apologize with you later.Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:08.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. Anyway, aren't you hungry?Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We are!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We all loved Scarlet-sama so much!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:23.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! She was always kind and gentle to us...Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I still remember the naughty room well!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the information!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The Palace is now the enemy's headquarters.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Leo.Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:45.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that! We'll save our princess at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:46.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,,They're...!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We're flying over the third level, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:09.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Robin-san! The Flower Field is on the next level!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's flying towards us from below!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:20.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The real Straw Hats are beyond my imagination as I thought...Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:27.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun, watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Pop Baller!Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.35,0:06:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Pop Fruit power!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:50.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! My Yellow Cubs...Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:54.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe there's a group that is trying to get to the Palace like that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:00.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Gladius!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Pop...Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:04.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Diez Fleurs!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:04.35,Note,,0,0,0,,Ten flowersDialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, take the key to the Flower Field!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:23.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Those toys...! Don't tell me...!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:30.53,Captions,,0,0,350,,The Former  Royal PlateauDialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:30.53,Main,,0,0,1,,You're both responsible.Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.23,0:07:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You still looking for something, Viola?Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar is awake now!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:39.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:42.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you talking about?! Sugar had been...Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,...completely knocked out with my Special Facial Jack in the Box,Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:51.02,Main,,0,0,0,,and it seemed like she wouldn't wake up for a couple days...Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:55.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats and the others... They don't know her, do they?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:57.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Or her ability.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:01.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar is totally recovered! Straw Hat and the others are in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:07.65,Captions,,100,0,355,,The PalaceDialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:20.65,Main,,0,0,0,,E-Everybody with a long nose, stay away! Everyone with a long nose, drop dead!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I thought you'd be hungry so I brought...Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.64,Main,,0,0,0,,They're just sausages.Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:31.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't bring me stick-shaped things!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:34.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Snacks must be grapes! Are you an idiot?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:39.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Turn into a Headcracker Doll like the others and go fight!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for Young Master-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:50.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll turn everyone in this country...Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,,...into toys again!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:57.65,Main,,0,0,0,,First, that damn, annoying long-nose and his friends!Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:08:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:06.00,Captions,,0,0,170,,The Plateau - Location of the Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:06.00,Captions,,600,0,635,,Team LuffyDialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Dodge, Farul!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:12.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Horse!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:14.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:17.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.15,0:09:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Farul!Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:25.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What a powerful jaw! It crushed his head!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.07,0:09:27.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't die on me, Farul!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:37.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What the... I blew a hole in its stomach!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:39.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You monster! How could you do this to Farul?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Blade of Beauty! Round Table!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:55.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:15.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they invincible?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.24,Main,,0,0,0,,RubberDialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,...UFO!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:03.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! If only I had the key to these cuffs,Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Something's falling from above!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:13.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't paying attention...Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,--Crest Head! --That must be Luffy-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:18.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Tra-guy-kun! You guys are here!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico-ya, where's the key?! Give it to me now!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:27.33,Main,,0,0,0,,She got away...Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:31.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, she's just one little tramp.Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:36.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I know she can't do anything even if she can get to the Palace.Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:39.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go after her and kill her later.Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.91,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Gladius.Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take care of you all first.Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave them in my hands.Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:49.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:50.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Tra-guy-kun! And Soldier-san, too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Just go now! To the Flower Field on the fourth level!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.81,0:11:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:02.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's waiting for you! Just go!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:07.55,Captions,,0,30,390,,Flower Field Fourth Step of the PalaceDialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the fourth level! We're here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:13.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-san and the others... Are they okay?Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I know they are! Usoland's friends are strong!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:20.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca-sama! We have to go save Princess Mansherry now!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:27.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it okay to leave you here alone?Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:31.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine! Lucy and the others will come soon!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Go save her!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:35.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Rebecca-sama, you take care, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:53.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Father-sama must be somewhere on this battlefield, too...Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody made it here, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.61,Main,,0,0,0,,It's you...Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.72,Captions2,,0,360,575,,Third step of the Mountain  That Holds the PalaceDialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:29.72,Main,,0,0,0,,--Luffy-senpai, let me take this! --Crest Head!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:30.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:42.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are balls of explosives! They'll explode before you deflect them!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:43.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! Cool!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I don't deserve such praise!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo...Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier-bility: Stairs!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Awesome! You saved us a lot of trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:21.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Please use it, Luffy-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Why're you looking the other way?Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Crest Head!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:34.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Not at all!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:38.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who has to thank you for being born!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.49,0:14:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We can go straight to the fourth level this way! Let's go, Tra-guy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.83,0:14:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:01.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Soldier!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:02.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go first!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, Soldier!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:09.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Cabbage!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:13.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll keep them here! Just go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,My beloved horse was harmed on this level!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:22.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't go farther without vengeance against those jerks!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:27.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, dodge! It's the bombs!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of it!Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.67,0:15:33.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Why not use your barriers?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bartolomeo!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:49.20,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a limit on the size of the barrier... that I can produce at once...Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.69,Main,,0,0,0,,And I used it up on that staircase!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:15:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,But that's all right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:03.56,Main,,0,0,0,,If it helps Luffy-senpai...Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to die!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You son of a...Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:15.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fight with you until you're able to use barriers so hang tough!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:22.19,Main,,0,0,0,,These dolls have no delicacy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:25.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Cinco Mano! Spank!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:25.23,Note,,0,0,0,,Five HandsDialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:34.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel...Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:35.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Rooster-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:43.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Our captain is...Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:47.51,Main,,0,0,0,,...worth risking...Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:50.03,Main,,0,0,0,,...even our lives!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:19.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy is always the trump card that leads us to victory!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleurs! Gigantesco Mano!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:27.63,Note,,0,0,0,,Thousand Flower: Gigantic HandDialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,--I won't let you lay a finger on Luffy! --That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:55.85,Captions,,0,0,420,,Acacia Town Sabo vs. Admiral FujitoraDialogue: 0,0:17:56.86,0:17:58.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You're an odd person.Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:18:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you wanted to keep us Navy at bay.Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:06.07,Main,,0,0,0,,How long will you keep up with the act?Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:08.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh boy...Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:14.68,Main,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I need people to go easy on me...Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:17.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't discriminate.Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You scare me.Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:23.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not known as number two of the Revolutionary Army for nothing, I guess.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm in a position that requires me to do this.Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:30.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Please understand.Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Gravity Blade!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:40.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Raging Tiger!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:55.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Horizontal gravity?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:02.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This is just what I expected from him!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,This jerk! What is he up to?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It's an all-or-nothing gamble.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm determined to bet my life on it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:31.98,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,If you lose your dice, the game is over before you can even roll.Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:43.60,Captions,,0,0,240,,The Plateau - Location of the Royal Palace  Level 4 The Sunflower FieldDialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:51.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Shame on you, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?! Why are you running?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:56.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you fighting?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:19:59.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a gladiator!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:02.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you came to kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:07.75,Main,,0,0,0,,At the Colosseum, I managed to put on some good shows using you but...Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,,...if you can't fight,Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:14.48,Main,,0,0,0,,you've served your purpose!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll... put an end to you now.Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:47.76,Main,,0,0,0,,No, wait...Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:52.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You prefer a gun, don't you?Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:55.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Because Scarlet...Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:20:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,...got killed by a gun!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:06.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Soldier-san!!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:10.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You're...Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.82,0:21:19.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take away...Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.68,Main,,0,0,0,,...another member of my family from me!!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:32.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This man was a legend.Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:36.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He was the strongest gladiator in the history of the Colosseum.Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:55.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Although I couldn't protect your mother,Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:59.63,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna protect you to the end, with my life!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.43,0:22:01.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let me teach you how to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:04.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.75,0:22:12.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Father-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:14.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Rebecca.Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:18.01,Main,,0,0,0,,As a toy with no future,Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.61,0:22:26.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a gentle person like your mother!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.11,0:22:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,But it ends today!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:37.41,Main,,0,0,0,,...don't have to fight anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.53,0:22:44.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:45.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:50.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, Kyros?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.11,0:22:52.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It means, today,Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:55.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll settle my score with all of you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.53,0:23:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You monster!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:15.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:20.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this...!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.81,0:23:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.93,0:23:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!!Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.98,0:23:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The key!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.10,0:23:49.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Great! We both made it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:01.99,Main,,0,0,0,,The key!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.39,0:24:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it to me now!Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it is!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.80,0:24:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.17,0:24:15.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.69,0:24:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You jerks!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.48,0:25:02.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Finally, we caught up with him!Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.38,0:25:04.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Finally... I'm free!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.43,0:25:10.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We're here! The fourth level - where Mingo is!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.83,0:25:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that where he is?Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.17,0:25:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.39,0:25:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Law! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.92,0:25:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamante.Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.31,0:25:29.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you two... My hands are full with this guy.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.85,0:25:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Could you take care of Doflamingo for me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.94,0:25:36.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.67,0:25:42.62,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000 Timing: Galaxy 9000, Sewil QC: Mr Luffy, Sewil Soundtracking: Halee TC/Infoboxes: Datenshi  Original Subtitles: Crunchyroll YibisDialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:44.62,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,